<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Bangalore to Sambalpur by Train | Railway Parcel Service
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I send my bike by train from Bangalore to Sambalpur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You can book Shree Ashirwad’s bike transport service online or via phone. Our team schedules a doorstep pickup in Bangalore, securely packs the bike, and loads it onto a dedicated railway parcel wagon. After rail transit, we handle station unloading and deliver the bike to your Sambalpur address, all within 3‑5 days.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the cost structure for bike transport Bangalore to Sambalpur via train?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The price includes a base freight charge based on distance, a fixed packing fee for our 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging, and a nominal insurance premium for 100% coverage. No hidden tolls or fuel surcharges apply, making the rail option up to 30% cheaper than road transport.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my bike fully insured during the rail journey and what does the insurance cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every bike shipped on our train parcel service is covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance policy worth the declared value. The policy protects against accidental damage, theft, and loss from loading to final delivery, ensuring a zero‑scratch guarantee backed by a claim settlement within 48 hours.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long will it take for my bike to reach Sambalpur after pickup in Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Typical transit time is 3‑5 business days. Day 1‑2 covers doorstep pickup, packaging, and loading at the Bangalore railway yard. Day 3‑4 involves rail movement across the 850 km corridor. Day 5 is dedicated to station unloading, final inspection, and doorstep delivery in Sambalpur.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What packing methods are used to prevent scratches on my bike during train transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a proprietary 7‑layer system: heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard sheets, stretch film, and custom wooden crates for vulnerable parts. The bike is also secured on hydraulic ramp trailers with ratchet lashings, ensuring zero movement and scratch‑free transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any restrictions or prohibited items when shipping a bike by train?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Standard restrictions apply: the bike must be road‑legal, without fuel in the tank, and any hazardous liquids or explosives are prohibited. Personal accessories like helmets and riding gear can be packed separately. Our team verifies compliance during the pre‑pickup inspection to avoid delays.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike’s location in real time during the rail journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Each shipment is equipped with a GPS tracker linked to our 24/7 monitoring dashboard. You receive a unique tracking ID and can view live location updates, estimated arrival time, and status alerts via SMS or email, ensuring full visibility from Bangalore to Sambalpur.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
